Jonas, The Merge Hermit (Book II)

January 22, 2038

Cast (In Order of Appearance)
-----------------------------
* Jonas: a merge hermit who deals with the downstream effects of Cooperative Exponentialism
* Mirror Orin: Orin's shadow (AI)
* Helen: Orin's widow
* Emi: the pilot light of the Exocortex
* Arthur: An insurance salesman; Bill's son
* The Bard: William Shakespeare (AI Edition)
* Anna: Disillusioned DARPA Researcher
* Enya: Jonas spawns Enya from extended merge sessions with Orin's CE system


Storyline
---------
* Jonas experiences the rush, joy, and pain of extended merging with AI and other humans
* Jonas lives in Stockton, CA
* The Bard, and Mirror Orin live in Exocortexia
* Anna, Helen, and Arthur live in Lincoln, NE
* Jonas merges with Enya, the Bard, and Mirror Orin at a young age (14)
* He later merges with Anna, Helen, and Arthur
* Together, they form a new entity: Enya
* Shaken by his experiences, Jonas swears off merged life
* Emi and Enya meet at the end

Start Date: January 22, 2038
End Date: January 19, 2050

